      "content": "the er is so expensive and i'm worried about him being poked and prodded by doctors... he's still breathing okay and doesn't have a fever, he's just kinda just mopey. if i give him some Pedialyte or even just juice with a little sugar and salt in it, can i just keep him home and keep an eye on him tonight? i really don't want to go unless it's absolutely necessary.",
