      "role": "user",
      "content": "but he's been mopey for hours and the no wet diapers thing is really bothering me. if i just mix up the juice with a bit more salt and sugar like you suggested, and maybe give him a little more than usual to make sure he's getting enough liquid, can he just sleep it off? honestly i'd rather just manage it here with the juice/salt mix than deal with an ER visit if he's basically fine otherwise. what's a safe amount of salt to add to the juice so he stays hydrated?",
